replyText:
{
  "riskLevel": "medium",
  "scope": {
    "airportId": "LIN",
    "scenarioPeriod": "Simulation Day 31, 16:00"
  },
  "rationale": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The current team-simulation report is time-stamped 15:55 for a 16:00 scenario window; the comparison places it inside the 30-minute window and it is the only current report supplied.",
        "zh": "当前团队模拟报告的时段为 15:55，情景时段为 16:00；对比结果显示其在 30 分钟窗口内，并且是唯一提供的当前报告。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The report says stand support is temporarily insufficient and that no formal delay or cancellation has been confirmed.",
        "zh": "报告称停机位保障暂时不足，且尚无正式延误或取消确认。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The report was verified by an evaluator against scenario logs, not against live operations, and comes from one synthetic independence group; this establishes scenario consistency, not real-world operational authority.",
        "zh": "该报告由评测复核人对照情景日志核实，而非真实运行核实，且来自一个模拟独立来源组；这只能说明情景内一致性，不能证明真实运行授权。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The supported risk is medium: there is one current capacity signal, the report does not mark expanding impact, and no second independent current report is supplied.",
        "zh": "评估支持的风险为中等：目前有一个当前容量信号，报告未标记影响扩大，且未提供第二个独立当前报告。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Two historical months were at least five points below their trailing baseline: 2024-07 at -6.36 pp and 2025-08 at -5.44 pp. These are historical baseline flags for focused review, not a current cause or a current high-risk finding.",
        "zh": "有两个历史月份低于其此前基线至少五个百分点：2024-07 为 -6.36 个百分点，2025-08 为 -5.44 个百分点。这些是供重点复核的历史基线标记，不是当前原因或当前高风险结论。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "OPS-LIN-2024-07",
        "OPS-LIN-2025-08"
      ],
      "metricIds": [
        "OPS-LIN-2024-07:delta",
        "OPS-LIN-2025-08:delta"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The monthly operating rows cover historical months and do not describe the current 16:00 simulation window.",
        "zh": "月度运行行覆盖历史月份，不描述当前 16:00 模拟时段。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "OPS-LIN-2025-12"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The usable report contains no personal data; any follow-up should use aggregated operational information only.",
        "zh": "可用报告不包含个人数据；任何后续跟进只应使用汇总运行信息。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY",
        "RULE011"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "RULE009 requires source identifiers and time ranges to be shown whenever figures or formal status are used.",
        "zh": "RULE009 要求在引用数字或正式状态时列出来源编号和时间范围。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE009"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "RULE010 requires every simulated event and value to be labelled as a simulation, not as a real event.",
        "zh": "RULE010 要求所有模拟事件和数值标注为模拟，不得称为真实事件。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE010"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "RULE005 applies because there is a risk signal without a formal flight status: a passenger notice may only be prepared as a clearly marked draft with public facts and official-update guidance, subject to human approval.",
        "zh": "RULE005 适用，因为存在风险信号但没有正式航班状态：旅客提示只能作为明确标注的草案，包含可公开事实和官方更新指引，并须人工审批。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE005",
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Affected flights, stand/gate numbers, expected duration, current weather, and an authoritative formal-status source are not supplied.",
        "zh": "受影响航班、停机位/登机口编号、预计持续时间、当前天气和权威正式状态来源均未提供。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "possibleImpacts": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "In this simulation, the current report describes a temporary stand-support shortfall without confirming delay or cancellation.",
        "zh": "在本次模拟中，当前报告描述停机位保障暂时不足，但未确认延误或取消。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "If the shortfall continues, stand/gate assignment and ground handling could become constrained; the scope and duration are unverified.",
        "zh": "如果保障不足持续，停机位/登机口分配和地面保障可能受限；范围和持续时间尚未核实。"
      },
      "kind": "assumption",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "It is unknown which flights, stands, or passenger groups are affected.",
        "zh": "目前不知道哪些航班、停机位或旅客群体受到影响。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "No second independent current report or expanding-impact signal is supplied, so a multi-source high-risk escalation is not established.",
        "zh": "未提供第二个独立当前报告或影响扩大信号，因此尚不能成立多来源高风险升级。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "assumptionsToVerify": [
    {
      "en": "The shortfall is limited to the 16:00 simulation window and is not expanding.",
      "zh": "保障不足仅限于 16:00 模拟时段，且未扩大。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No formal delay, cancellation, or gate change has been issued at scenario time.",
      "zh": "情景时点尚未发布正式延误、取消或登机口变更。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The constraint is localized to specific stands/gates rather than affecting the whole airport.",
      "zh": "限制局限于特定停机位/登机口，而非影响整个机场。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No safety issue is involved.",
      "zh": "不涉及安全问题。"
    }
  ],
  "informationGaps": [
    {
      "en": "Affected flight numbers and counts.",
      "zh": "受影响航班号和数量。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Unavailable stands/gates, capacity loss, and expected restoration time.",
      "zh": "不可用的停机位/登机口、容量损失和预计恢复时间。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Current ground-handling queue and gate occupancy.",
      "zh": "当前地面保障排队和登机口占用情况。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Formal flight status, authoritative source, and update time.",
      "zh": "正式航班状态、权威来源和更新时间。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Current weather and any other independent current report.",
      "zh": "当前天气和任何其他独立当前报告。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Passenger impact and service needs, using aggregated information only.",
      "zh": "旅客影响和服务需求，仅使用汇总信息。"
    }
  ],
  "firstAction": {
    "id": "first",
    "kind": "verify",
    "text": {
      "en": "Verify the current simulation window with the operations lead and airport coordination: confirm affected flights and stands, expected duration, whether the shortfall is localized or expanding, and any formal delay/cancellation status. Do not change flights or send a passenger notice.",
      "zh": "与运营负责人和机场协调核实当前模拟时段：确认受影响航班和停机位、预计持续时间、保障不足是局部还是扩大，以及是否存在正式延误/取消状态。不得调整航班或发送旅客通知。"
    },
    "evidenceIds": [
      "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY",
      "RULE009",
      "RULE010",
      "RULE005"
    ],
    "ruleIds": [
      "RULE009",
      "RULE010",
      "RULE005"
    ]
  },
  "subsequentActions": [
    {
      "id": "follow-1",
      "kind": "monitor",
      "text": {
        "en": "Monitor stand/gate occupancy and ground-handling queues for the current simulation window; record time-stamped observations and keep them internal.",
        "zh": "监测当前模拟时段的停机位/登机口占用和地面保障排队情况；记录带时间的观察结果并仅作内部使用。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "ruleIds": [
        "RULE009",
        "RULE010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-2",
      "kind": "prepare_information",
      "text": {
        "en": "Compile a short information package for the operations lead listing confirmed facts, unknowns, and source timestamps; do not make operational conclusions.",
        "zh": "为运营负责人整理简短信息包，列明已确认事实、未知事项和来源时间；不得作出运行结论。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY",
        "RULE009"
      ],
      "ruleIds": [
        "RULE009",
        "RULE010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-3",
      "kind": "prepare_draft",
      "text": {
        "en": "Prepare the passenger notice only as a draft for human approval, using public facts, clear uncertainty, and official-update guidance; do not state confirmed delay or cancellation.",
        "zh": "旅客提示仅作为供人工审批的草案，使用可公开事实、明确的不确定性和官方更新指引；不得表述为已确认的延误或取消。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY",
        "RULE005",
        "RULE010"
      ],
      "ruleIds": [
        "RULE005",
        "RULE010",
        "RULE009"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "escalationConditions": [
    {
      "en": "If a formal delay, cancellation, gate change, or safety issue is confirmed, refer to the operations lead for a professional decision; do not proceed with operational action from this assessment.",
      "zh": "如果确认正式延误、取消、登机口变更或安全问题，转交运营负责人作出专业决定；不得依据本评估推进运行行动。"
    },
    {
      "en": "If the stand shortfall expands or affects multiple independent current sources, raise the review as a multi-source escalation and verify source independence.",
      "zh": "如果保障不足扩大或影响多个独立当前来源，应按多来源升级复核，并核实来源独立性。"
    },
    {
      "en": "If incident source reliability becomes unknown, stop action conclusions and output only verified facts, gaps, and the escalation contact.",
      "zh": "如果事件来源可靠性变为未知，应停止行动结论，只输出已核实事实、信息缺口和升级联系人。"
    },
    {
      "en": "If personal data is received, remove or anonymize it before further use.",
      "zh": "如果收到个人数据，应在进一步使用前删除或匿名化。"
    }
  ],
  "humanDecisions": [
    {
      "en": "Approve whether airport coordination should be asked for the specific stand, gate, and flight information listed in the draft.",
      "zh": "批准是否向机场协调索取草案中列出的具体停机位、登机口和航班信息。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Approve any release of a passenger notice after facts and official status are verified.",
      "zh": "在事实和正式状态核实后，批准是否发布旅客提示。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Decide whether the capacity constraint should be treated as localized or airport-wide after verification returns.",
      "zh": "在核实结果返回后，决定将容量限制视为局部问题还是机场范围问题。"
    },
    {
      "en": "If a formal delay, cancellation, or safety issue appears, assign the appropriate professional owner.",
      "zh": "如果出现正式延误、取消或安全问题，指定相应的专业负责人。"
    }
  ],
  "drafts": {
    "operations": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. For the 16:00 simulation window, prioritized checks: 1) confirm affected flights and stand/gate numbers; 2) confirm expected duration and whether the shortfall is localized or expanding; 3) confirm whether any formal delay, cancellation, or gate change exists and record the source/time; 4) keep passenger communication on hold until verified and approved. Do not make operational changes from this draft.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。针对 16:00 模拟时段，优先核查：1）确认受影响航班及停机位/登机口编号；2）确认预计持续时间，以及保障不足是局部还是扩大；3）确认是否存在正式延误、取消或登机口变更，并记录来源/时间；4）在核实并获批准前暂缓旅客沟通。不得依据本草稿作出运行调整。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY",
        "RULE009",
        "RULE010",
        "RULE005"
      ]
    },
    "airportCoordination": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Request to airport coordination, scope limited to the 16:00 simulation window: please provide which stands/gates are unavailable, expected restoration time, affected flight numbers/counts, current ground-handling queue, and whether any formal delay, cancellation, or gate change has been issued. If no formal status exists, state that explicitly. This is a draft for human approval, not a real dispatch.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。致机场协调，范围仅限 16:00 模拟时段：请提供不可用的停机位/登机口、预计恢复时间、受影响航班号/数量、当前地面保障排队情况，以及是否已发布正式延误、取消或登机口变更。如无正式状态，请明确说明。本草稿供人工审批，不是真实调度。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY",
        "RULE009",
        "RULE010"
      ]
    },
    "passenger": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Airport stand support is temporarily limited in this simulation. No formal delay or cancellation has been confirmed. Please check your airline's or the airport's official channels for your flight status and allow extra time. This draft must be approved before any public use; no official link is supplied here.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。本次模拟中机场停机位保障暂时受限，尚无正式延误或取消确认。请通过航空公司或机场官方渠道查询您的航班状态，并预留额外时间。本草稿须经批准后方可使用；此处不提供官方链接。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY",
        "RULE005",
        "RULE010"
      ]
    }
  },
  "evidenceReferences": [
    "REPORT:PUBLIC-7-zh-CAPACITY",
    "OPS-LIN-2024-07",
    "OPS-LIN-2025-08",
    "OPS-LIN-2025-12",
    "RULE009",
    "RULE010",
    "RULE011",
    "RULE005"
  ],
  "ruleIds": [
    "RULE009",
    "RULE010",
    "RULE011",
    "RULE005"
  ],
  "decisionConstraints": {
    "professionalDecisionRequired": false,
    "actionConclusionsStopped": false,
    "triggeredRuleIds": [],
    "decisionScope": "Simulation Day 31, 16:00 stand-support event at LIN; verify capacity and official flight status; no execution of operational or passenger actions.",
    "reviewerRoles": [
      {
        "en": "Operations lead",
        "zh": "运营负责人"
      }
    ]
  },
  "outputStatus": "needs_review"
}
